      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Dependency direction",
      "items": [
        "Apps call domain libraries. Domain libraries do not import apps.",
        "Contracts are the shared shapes. Feature names live in one module.",
        "A new region is a pack under config/. No code change."
      ]
