    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Where science lives",
      "items": [
        "Detection, plume, and incidents are deterministic intelligence code.",
        "Training and serving share the feature pipeline and the preprocessing steps.",
        "Gemini is imported only by the copilot and vision adapters."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Storage is chosen, not coded in",
      "items": [
        "AEROPULSE_PLATFORM=local or gcp selects the adapters.",
        "Domain code does not import a cloud SDK.",
        "Demo recordings are generated by the real cycle and are not written to live storage."
